{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>STORY</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new country promises peace. Yet every night, you wake in the same place. Rooms washed in yellow light, stretching on forever. Something is waiting there, whispering your name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>GAMEPLAY</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Than Just Walking</strong>: Navigate environmental challenges, interact with the world, and uncover hidden mechanics that go beyond simple exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror with Depth</strong>: Tension builds through atmosphere, sound, and unsettling encounters, avoiding reliance on simple jump scares.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Unpredictable Journey</strong>:\u00a0 No clear path, no certainty. Just the overwhelming feeling that something is terribly wrong.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i><br><br> <br> <br><i>Welcome to the Facility of Dusk. </i><br> <br> <br> <br> <br> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3616240?t=1761935239","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616240/b8bcb5a6514588c7ffcd68d2427672378b0a1331/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761935239","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616240/2fede4d939e9b0988937e18e230f8e0afdd7e622/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761935239","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616240/2fede4d939e9b0988937e18e230f8e0afdd7e622/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761935239","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains psychological horror elements and therefore might not be suitable for all audienc